Description: Cockpit file sharing manager for SMB, NFS and FTP
 ShareHub adds a "File Sharing" page to Cockpit. Each share is one folder
 that can be published over SMB, NFS and FTP/FTPS at the same time, with
 one list of allowed users and groups.
 .
 Features: local users with one password for the system and Samba,
 per-user home folders, macOS optimisations and Time Machine targets,
 recycle bin with retention, Windows Previous Versions from ZFS or Btrfs
 snapshots, Active Directory membership through winbind, live connection
 monitoring, firewall helpers, change history with restore, and import of
 shares created by other tools.
